# Shared by both builds (context = repository root):
#   docker build -f topcoat.Dockerfile .  -> topcoat
#   docker build -f nextjs/Dockerfile .   -> Next.js
# Each Dockerfile COPYs only the paths it needs; this file keeps the context
# small and keeps host build output and secrets out of it.

.git
.claude
.playwright-mcp
.vercel
.env*
**/.DS_Store

# Build output and dependencies (regenerated in the builder)
**/target
**/node_modules
**/.next
topcoat/assets
nextjs/public/images
nextjs/src/generated

# Not used by either image
bench
docs
scripts
**/*.md
